cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use KRY, please cite it as below."
title: "KRY — Verifiable Receipts for Reported LLM Efficiency Events"
abstract: >-
  KRY is a zero-dependency, pure-Python-stdlib library for tamper-evident receipts
  of reported LLM efficiency events. A stranger verifier checks hash-chain integrity
  and supported benchmark arithmetic offline. The veracity_floor discloses the share
  assigned to tiers above self-report; underlying evidence requires separate checks.
  Receipt verification does not establish actual provider charges or cash savings.
type: software
